      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1860 the arrival of the Jackson, Lansing & Northern Railroad—later the Michigan Central—re‑named the town Laingsburg and sparked its growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
